# tally 2.2.1 P35 (L §8.2 l.2248, "an entry is listed under a result exactly when a read in its set gave it", whatever
# the form of the line, its outcome, or the way a movement came not to count): N2, a refused balance lists its assumed: rows like a value
# (review g2 reg/r4). Before W8: no line.
=== r4.tally
model r4
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place sav: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input w: date
input w4: date
input z: int
input pay: money PLN
input pay2: money PLN
def q: money PLN
  rule base = round(pay / z, minor(PLN), half-even)
move bad: transfers
  on w
  leg cash from world to konto amount q
move ps: transfers
  on w4
  leg cash from world to sav amount pay2
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 100.00 PLN assumed "the card names no pay"
  pay2 = 70.00 PLN assumed "the card names no second pay"
  z = 0 assumed "the card names no divisor"
  w = 2026-03-10 "s"
  w4 = window(2026-03-10, 2026-03-12) "s"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[sav] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
ask a0: bal(konto, 2026-03-31)
ask aq: q
ask aq2: q, pay
ask aq3: pay2, q
ask hole: bal(sav, 2026-03-11)
ask hole2: bal(sav, 2026-03-09)
ask after: bal(sav, 2026-03-31)
ask fm: flows(bad, 2026-03)
ask fk: flows(konto, 2026-03)
ask before: bal(konto, 2026-03-05)
ask ok: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) with z = 4
ask ck: check q == pay
ask ex: explain bal(konto, 2026-03-31)
ask pr: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) from 2026-03-01
=== expect a0
a0: refused: RUN-DIV division by zero
  assumed: the card names no divisor (z)
  assumed: the card names no pay (pay)
  cut 2026-01-01
